OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning as recycling truck
OL,4,Acatches fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent council has warned about the
OL,7,Fdangers of failing to dispose of
OL,8,Fbatteries correctly after a recycling
OL,9,Ftruck caught fire.
OL,11,FMaidstone Borough Council said that
OL,12,Fwhile the "exact cause" of the fire in
OL,13,FBraddick Close, Maidstone, on Thursday
OL,14,Fmorning has not yet been confirmed,
OL,15,F"early indications point to an
OL,16,Felectrical fire".
OL,18,FThe council highlighted a campaign
OL,19,Flaunched by Kent Fire and Rescue
OL,20,FService (KFRS) earlier this month,
OL,21,Furging people to properly dispose of
OL,22,Fbatteries.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
