OL,3,GNEWSABattery warning as recycling truck
OL,4,Acatches fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to KFRS, the number of
OL,7,Fbattery fires involving waste sites and
OL,8,Fvehicles has increased sevenfold in the
OL,9,Flast seven years, with the number of
OL,10,Fincidents reported to KFRS this year
OL,11,Falready exceeding the total in 2025.
